  "title": "This Free Repo Turns Claude Into a 100-Agent Team",
  "description": "Comment \"FLOW\" and I'll send you the link\n\n\nRuflo, which used to be called Claude Flow, is a free repo that turns Claude Code into a team of over a hundred agents.\n\n\nInstead of one agent at a time, you spin up a whole group in different formations shaped for different work.\n\n\nBuilding an app, one takes the architecture, one the front end, one the tests, and they hand off on their own.\n\n\nIt's open source and runs through the same command line you already use for Claude Code.",
